        },
        {
          "text": "Basi watu wa Israeli walikuwa wameapa huko katika Mispa, wakisema, Hapana mtu awaye yote kwetu sisi atakayemwoza binti yake kumpa Benyamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.1",
