        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Benyamini wakarudi wakati huo; nao wakawapa wale wanawake waliowaponya wali hai katika hao wanawake wa Yabesh-gileadi; lakini hawakuwatosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao watu wakaghairi kwa ajili ya Benyamini, kwa sababu BWANA alikuwa amefanya pengo katika hizo kabila za Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
