            "sid": "JDG 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo hao wazee wa huo mkutano walisema, Je! Tufanyeje ili tuwapatie wake hao waliosalia, kwa kuwa wanawake wameangamizwa katika Benyamini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakasema, Lazima kuwa urithi kwa hao wa Benyamini waliopona, isiwe kabila kufutika katika Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.11.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amu 11:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini sisi hatuwezi kuwaoza binti zetu kwa maana wana wa Israeli walikuwa wameapa, wakisema, Na alaaniwe huyo atakayempa Benyamini mke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha wakasema, Angalieni, iko sikukuu ya BWANA mwaka baada ya mwaka katika Shilo, ulioko upande kaskazini wa Betheli, upande wa mashariki wa hiyo njia kuu iendeayo kutoka Betheli kwenda Shekemu, nao ni upande wa kusini wa Lebona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi wakawaagiza hao wana wa Benyamini wakisema, Haya, endeni, mkaotee katika mashamba ya mizabibu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
