              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha itakuwa, hapo baba zao au ndugu zao, watakapokuja kushitaki, sisi tutawaambia, Kwa ihisani yenu tupeni sisi; kwa kuwa hatukumtwalia kila mtu mkewe katika vita; wala ninyi hamkuwapa wao, au kama sivyo ninyi sasa mngekuwa na hatia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
